<p>Kehti thi baanoe muztar alvida<br />
chaar saala meri dukhtar alvida</p>

<p>Ae meri tutlaane waali laadli<br />
meri beti maahe paikar alvida</p>

<p>sone waali seenae shabbir ki<br />
zeenate aaghoshe maadar alvida</p>

<p>durre khaanne waali meri naaznee'n <br />
marne waali zulm uthaakar alvida<br />
</p>